{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f3f92819c5d6f0ce4a919c93cfa92f50.poster.avif?t=1762771074\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f3f92819c5d6f0ce4a919c93cfa92f50.webm?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f3f92819c5d6f0ce4a919c93cfa92f50.mp4?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Papercraft Tactics</strong>\u00a0is a run\u2011based, grid\u2011inventory roguelike with semi\u2011auto, turn\u2011based combat. You don\u2019t just equip items\u2014you <strong>wire</strong> them. Put swords next to potions, feed power from wands into shields, and rotate gear so inputs meet outputs. When a turn starts, your backpack comes alive: links fire, effects cascade, and enemies learn to fear tidy layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, draft new items, shop, and re\u2011arrange for ever\u2011bigger chains. During fights, play a handful of clutch <strong>cards</strong> to tweak the queue\u2014double a hit, purge a debuff, or force a trigger now. The joy is in the planning: make a build that plays itself, then nudge it at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this unfolds in a warm <strong>paper\u2011theater</strong> aesthetic\u2014cut\u2011out characters, stage\u2011flat scenery, and a subtle handmade vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/91bbb3997da9a35107749f041edeacea.poster.avif?t=1762771074\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/91bbb3997da9a35107749f041edeacea.webm?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/91bbb3997da9a35107749f041edeacea.mp4?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Core Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Draft</strong> new items with distinct <strong>inputs/outputs</strong> and tags (elemental, heavy, fragile, scaling, mimic).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrange</strong> items on a <strong>grid</strong>; rotate to align <strong>green inputs</strong> and <strong>yellow outputs</strong>; place for adjacency bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle (auto\u2011resolve, turn\u2011based):</strong> At turn start, linked items <strong>trigger</strong> in order, adding <strong>Actions</strong> to the queue (Attack, MagicCast, Recover, Block, InflictEffect, Special).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Cards</strong> to manipulate the queue (duplicate, remove, reset exhausted, trigger now) or inflict effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong> through events, shops, and escalating encounters; refine the build; beat the boss; try a new hero.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes, Stats &amp; Resistances</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from distinct heroes with unique <strong>passives</strong> and stat profiles. Core stats include <strong>HP, SP, MP, STR, DEF, MND, SPR, Evade</strong>. Resistances cover <strong>physical types</strong> (Slash, Thrust, Strike, Projectile, Spell) and <strong>elements</strong> (Fire, Ice, Wind, Thunder, True). Synergies are predictable and readable\u2014builds reward planning, not twitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f856eab97091da70ceb71af18713f804.poster.avif?t=1762771074\" width=676 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f856eab97091da70ceb71af18713f804.webm?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f856eab97091da70ceb71af18713f804.mp4?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Backpack:</strong> Your grid inventory <i>is</i> the build. Rotate, link, and position to forge synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain\u2011Reaction Combat:</strong> On <strong>OnPlayerTurnStart</strong>, items trigger and fill the action queue\u2014combos you designed go off automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Card Play:</strong> Limited\u2011use cards let you push the queue\u2014<strong>DuplicateNextAction</strong>, <strong>ClearAttacks</strong>, <strong>ResetExhaustedCards</strong>, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Readable Triggers:</strong> Clear events like <strong>OnSlashHit</strong>, <strong>OnReceiveFireDamage</strong>, <strong>OnEvade</strong> power effects without hidden rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling &amp; Mimic Items:</strong> Effects that grow from HP/MP/SP or <strong>copy</strong> linked behavior to extend chains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run\u2011Based Variety:</strong> Shops, events, elites, and bosses with different resist profiles make placement matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paper\u2011Theater Style:</strong> Hand\u2011drawn lines, cut\u2011out layers, and cozy stage lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Dead Turns:</strong> Even defense builds feel active via blocks, conversions, and smart queue tweaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learnable Depth:</strong> Simple pieces, deep compositions\u2014like building a Rube Goldberg machine that fights back.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3380700?t=1762771074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3380700?t=1762771074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/5d01323d165ea686b3272e06085249c3e42ec53c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762771074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/5d01323d165ea686b3272e06085249c3e42ec53c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762771074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3775350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f3f92819c5d6f0ce4a919c93cfa92f50.poster.avif?t=1762771074\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f3f92819c5d6f0ce4a919c93cfa92f50.webm?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f3f92819c5d6f0ce4a919c93cfa92f50.mp4?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Papercraft Tactics</strong>\u00a0is a run\u2011based, grid\u2011inventory roguelike with semi\u2011auto, turn\u2011based combat. You don\u2019t just equip items\u2014you <strong>wire</strong> them. Put swords next to potions, feed power from wands into shields, and rotate gear so inputs meet outputs. When a turn starts, your backpack comes alive: links fire, effects cascade, and enemies learn to fear tidy layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, draft new items, shop, and re\u2011arrange for ever\u2011bigger chains. During fights, play a handful of clutch <strong>cards</strong> to tweak the queue\u2014double a hit, purge a debuff, or force a trigger now. The joy is in the planning: make a build that plays itself, then nudge it at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this unfolds in a warm <strong>paper\u2011theater</strong> aesthetic\u2014cut\u2011out characters, stage\u2011flat scenery, and a subtle handmade vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/91bbb3997da9a35107749f041edeacea.poster.avif?t=1762771074\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/91bbb3997da9a35107749f041edeacea.webm?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/91bbb3997da9a35107749f041edeacea.mp4?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Core Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Draft</strong> new items with distinct <strong>inputs/outputs</strong> and tags (elemental, heavy, fragile, scaling, mimic).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrange</strong> items on a <strong>grid</strong>; rotate to align <strong>green inputs</strong> and <strong>yellow outputs</strong>; place for adjacency bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle (auto\u2011resolve, turn\u2011based):</strong> At turn start, linked items <strong>trigger</strong> in order, adding <strong>Actions</strong> to the queue (Attack, MagicCast, Recover, Block, InflictEffect, Special).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Cards</strong> to manipulate the queue (duplicate, remove, reset exhausted, trigger now) or inflict effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong> through events, shops, and escalating encounters; refine the build; beat the boss; try a new hero.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes, Stats &amp; Resistances</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from distinct heroes with unique <strong>passives</strong> and stat profiles. Core stats include <strong>HP, SP, MP, STR, DEF, MND, SPR, Evade</strong>. Resistances cover <strong>physical types</strong> (Slash, Thrust, Strike, Projectile, Spell) and <strong>elements</strong> (Fire, Ice, Wind, Thunder, True). Synergies are predictable and readable\u2014builds reward planning, not twitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f856eab97091da70ceb71af18713f804.poster.avif?t=1762771074\" width=676 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f856eab97091da70ceb71af18713f804.webm?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/extras/f856eab97091da70ceb71af18713f804.mp4?t=1762771074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Backpack:</strong> Your grid inventory <i>is</i> the build. Rotate, link, and position to forge synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain\u2011Reaction Combat:</strong> On <strong>OnPlayerTurnStart</strong>, items trigger and fill the action queue\u2014combos you designed go off automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Card Play:</strong> Limited\u2011use cards let you push the queue\u2014<strong>DuplicateNextAction</strong>, <strong>ClearAttacks</strong>, <strong>ResetExhaustedCards</strong>, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Readable Triggers:</strong> Clear events like <strong>OnSlashHit</strong>, <strong>OnReceiveFireDamage</strong>, <strong>OnEvade</strong> power effects without hidden rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling &amp; Mimic Items:</strong> Effects that grow from HP/MP/SP or <strong>copy</strong> linked behavior to extend chains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run\u2011Based Variety:</strong> Shops, events, elites, and bosses with different resist profiles make placement matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paper\u2011Theater Style:</strong> Hand\u2011drawn lines, cut\u2011out layers, and cozy stage lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Dead Turns:</strong> Even defense builds feel active via blocks, conversions, and smart queue tweaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learnable Depth:</strong> Simple pieces, deep compositions\u2014like building a Rube Goldberg machine that fights back.</p></li></ul>","developers":["AGE Zero"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/8bbb1e28ad263b7a5ca0756805e40cd6f57bc848/header.jpg?t=1762771074","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"AGE Zero\u2122","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3380700/597804011/5519d714c3bb60a98423f884d5e3150dd4f9decb/1758698458/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758700372","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3380700/597804011/5519d714c3bb60a98423f884d5e3150dd4f9decb/1758698458/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758700372","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3380700/597804011/5519d714c3bb60a98423f884d5e3150dd4f9decb/1758698458/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758700372","id":257205260,"name":"Demo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205260/1f131afa994efc08c63579e0bb80d206d59fcc97/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758700372"}],"name":"Papercraft Tactics","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5GHz Quad Core +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD R9 280X +<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["AGE Zero"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q1 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/70dd720efa191633eca75bc36b03f30c0f07d519/ss_70dd720efa191633eca75bc36b03f30c0f07d519.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762771074","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/70dd720efa191633eca75bc36b03f30c0f07d519/ss_70dd720efa191633eca75bc36b03f30c0f07d519.600x338.jpg?t=1762771074"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap